# Tests compare file bytes and hash fixture files, so a checkout must produce the same
# bytes on every platform. Without this, `autocrlf` on Windows rewrites the fixtures and
# a byte-equality test fails for a reason that has nothing to do with the code.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
*.duckdb binary
*.db binary

# GitHub rendering
*.md text diff=markdown
